=== Refinement Types Sample ===
--- Simple refinement: AdultAge ---
  AdultAge age = 20 -> 20
--- Compound refinement: Percentage ---
  Percentage pct = 75 -> 75
  Percentage zero = 0 -> 0
  Percentage full = 100 -> 100
--- Union with refinements: AgeRange ---
  AgeRange childAge = 5 -> Union_Byte_Int32
  AgeRange byteVal = 50 -> Union_Byte_Int32
--- Property pattern refinement: ValidInterval ---
  Interval(10, 50) is ValidInterval -> true
  Interval(-5, 10) is ValidInterval -> false
--- Compile-time accepted literals ---
  AdultAge exactly18 = 18 -> 18
  AdultAge senior = 65 -> 65
--- Runtime validation: pattern matching ---
  userInput 25 is AdultAge -> true, validAge = 25
  userInput 10 is AdultAge -> false
--- Refinement as method parameter ---
  DescribeAge(30) -> Adult age is 30
--- Refinement as method return type ---
  GetDefaultAdultAge() -> 25
--- Refinement as field type ---
  Person(Name=Alice, Age=18)
  person.Age -> 18
--- Flow-sensitive narrowing ---
  x=21, after if (x >= 18): narrowed = 21
--- Arithmetic produces base type ---
  AdultAge a = 20, a + 5 -> 25 (type: int)
  a - 2 -> 18 (type: int)
--- Subset assignability ---
  DrinkingAge 21 assigned to AdultAge -> 21
  DrinkingAge 30 assigned to AdultAge -> 30
--- Widening to base type ---
  AdultAge 40 widened to int -> 40
  Percentage 50 widened to int -> 50
--- Runtime boundary ---
  18 is AdultAge -> True, 17 is AdultAge -> False
  Interval(10, 50) as ValidInterval: End -> 50
Done!
